### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Search nearby
GET http://localhost:5000/api/nearby?lat=37.77&lon=-122.42&radius=5000&limit=10

### Get business by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/business/123

### Create business
POST http://localhost:5000/api/business
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Coffee",
  "latitude": 37.77,
  "longitude": -122.42,
  "category": "Cafe",
  "address": "1 Main St",
  "phone": "555-0100"
}

### Update business
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/business/123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Coffee Updated",
  "latitude": 47.61,
  "longitude": -122.33,
  "category": "Cafe",
  "address": "1 Main St",
  "phone": "555-0101"
}

### Delete business
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/business/4d31e57a-8b1e-4c09-ac5f-a4030d9c0b68